WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.126 --> 00:00:03.369
I'm looking at my DNA results,
and I need answers.

00:00:03.402 --> 00:00:07.440
 ( music playing )

00:00:07.473 --> 00:00:10.443
Coming soon, five new episodes
of "Glad You Asked"

00:00:10.476 --> 00:00:14.280
 exploring the impact of race
 in society on our health.

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.482
Good morning.
So I'm stopping breathing.

00:00:16.515 --> 00:00:20.053
- 4.7 times an hour.
- Headphones on.

00:00:20.086 --> 00:00:22.789
It's so loud.

00:00:22.822 --> 00:00:24.791
I feel like I don't know
what I'm doing.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.460
So an idea that came
from slavery

00:00:27.493 --> 00:00:31.197
has lingered in the medical
field through to today.

00:00:31.230 --> 00:00:35.334
Is there a difference
between race in medicine
and racism in medicine?

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:37.370
Oh, hell, yeah.

00:00:37.403 --> 00:00:40.673
 What does all that noise
 mean for our health?

00:00:40.706 --> 00:00:42.442
 You may have
 a hearing problem.

00:00:42.475 --> 00:00:44.811
 A single exposure
for even a fraction of a second

00:00:44.844 --> 00:00:50.450
at 140 decibels could be
sufficient to cause that
instantaneous damage.

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:52.151
What happens to us
when we lose sleep?

00:00:52.184 --> 00:00:53.486
What is this?

00:00:53.519 --> 00:00:55.822
For one week
go to bed when you're tired.

00:00:55.855 --> 00:00:59.258
and then wake up
when you are rested,
but no alarm clock.

00:00:59.291 --> 00:01:01.227
That sounds amazing.
( yawns )

00:01:01.260 --> 00:01:03.663
I'm so tired.

00:01:03.696 --> 00:01:06.199
 How come so many people
 aren't accessing therapy?

00:01:06.232 --> 00:01:08.868
You know, just like the rest
of society has to do the work

00:01:08.901 --> 00:01:11.270
in order to be anti-racist,

00:01:11.303 --> 00:01:14.140
 the same has to happen
 in the therapeutic space.

00:01:14.173 --> 00:01:17.777
 It's really hard to separate
 out my desire to have kids

00:01:17.810 --> 00:01:20.446
 versus the expectation
 to have kids.

00:01:20.479 --> 00:01:22.515
Our biology does not keep up
with our social progress.

00:01:22.548 --> 00:01:26.453
 "Glad You Asked,"
 an all new season coming soon.

